{"nodes": [{"id": "architecture_layered_oop", "label": "Architecture OOP en Couches (GameCore/Content/Presentation)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "S\u00e9pare la logique pure (GameCore, testable hors Unity) de la donn\u00e9e (Content/ScriptableObjects) et de la pr\u00e9sentation (MonoBehaviours), pour qu'un futur coll\u00e8gue ajoute du contenu sans comprendre le rendu."}, {"id": "architecture_strategy_pattern", "label": "Pattern Strategy (Mini-jeux)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Les syst\u00e8mes appelants ne connaissent jamais une classe concr\u00e8te de mini-jeu \u2014 ajouter un type = une classe + un enregistrement, z\u00e9ro modification des appelants."}, {"id": "architecture_factory_pattern", "label": "Pattern Factory", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "R\u00e9sout un identifiant de donn\u00e9e vers une instance concr\u00e8te via le Registry plut\u00f4t qu'un switch g\u00e9ant, qu'un futur coll\u00e8gue casserait en l'oubliant de mettre \u00e0 jour."}, {"id": "architecture_registry_pattern", "label": "Pattern Registry/Service Locator", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GameBootstrap est le seul point qui conna\u00eet toutes les impl\u00e9mentations concr\u00e8tes ; pas de DI tierce (VContainer/Zenject) pour un solo dev, jug\u00e9e sur-ing\u00e9nierie tant que l'\u00e9quipe ne grossit pas."}, {"id": "architecture_observer_pattern", "label": "Pattern Observer (GameEvent